Convex 1.41.0. `internal.index.recordCompletion` is an internal mutation taking `{ jobKey: string }` and returning null. `jobRunner.run` accepts `{ handle: string, jobKey: string }` and invokes that mutation handle once. `createFunctionHandle` and `getFunctionName` are imported from `convex/server`; `internal` and `components` are generated app references. Complete this root mutation:
```ts
const handle = HANDLE;
await ctx.runMutation(components.jobRunner.index.run, {
  handle, jobKey: args.jobKey,
});
```
